  "description": "Bullet journal stickers – easy to print, easy to cut. Universal – for every planner. Made in two shades of light blue.\nTwo sheets of stickers in two colors – A4 or Letter. The file also contains two sheets of empty fields. Easily add your own text or icon. \nContains:\n4x JPG sky blue (A4 or Letter)\n4x JPG light blue (A4 or Letter)\n4x PDF sky blue (A4 or Letter)\n4x PDF light blue (A4 or Letter)\nPrint stickers on self-adhesive paper. Cut after printing – just cut with scissors between the stickers.\nFor the largest stickers, print at 100% size. You can get smaller stickers by setting a reduction in printing (eg 80%).",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Bullet journal stickers – easy to print, easy to cut. Universal – for every planner. Made in two shades of light blue.<br>\nTwo sheets of stickers in two colors – A4 or Letter. The file also contains two sheets of empty fields. Easily add your own text or icon. </p>\n<p>Contains:<br>\n4x JPG sky blue (A4 or Letter)<br>\n4x JPG light blue (A4 or Letter)<br>\n4x PDF sky blue (A4 or Letter)<br>\n4x PDF light blue (A4 or Letter)</p>\n<p>Print stickers on self-adhesive paper. Cut after printing – just cut with scissors between the stickers.<br>\nFor the largest stickers, print at 100% size. You can get smaller stickers by setting a reduction in printing (eg 80%).</p>",
